{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLinkTopology","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLinkTopology","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":36,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.unlink_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.unlink_C","kind":"theorem","line":348,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L348-L350","doc":"`σ₁ σ₁⁻¹` (unlink) records zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.single_crossing_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.single_crossing_C","kind":"theorem","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L342-L346","doc":"A single crossing `σ₁` (a 2-strand braid closing to the unknot, one component)\nalso records `C 0 1 = 1`; the closure is a knot, so this is self-crossing data, not\ninter-component linking — the pure-braid hypothesis is load-bearing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.hopf_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.hopf_C","kind":"theorem","line":338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L338-L340","doc":"The 2-strand full twist `σ₁²` closes to the Hopf link: `C 0 1 = 2`, so `lk = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.init","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.init","kind":"def","line":335,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L335-L336","doc":"Identity labelling, zero crossings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_braid","kind":"theorem","line":326,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L326-L331","doc":"Mutual helicity is unchanged by the braid relation anywhere in a word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_R2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_R2","kind":"theorem","line":319,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L319-L324","doc":"Mutual helicity is unchanged by Reidemeister II anywhere in a word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_mutualHelicity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_mutualHelicity","kind":"theorem","line":307,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L307-L317","doc":"**Helicity jump under a crossing change.**  The mutual helicity changes by exactly\n`-2 · sgn e · Γₐ · Γ_b`: a single reconnection-type crossing change between tubes of\ncirculation `Γₐ, Γ_b` alters helicity by `2 Γₐ Γ_b` in magnitude. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity_sub","kind":"theorem","line":285,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L285-L305","doc":"Algebraic core: a symmetric rank-two change of the crossing matrix moves the\nmutual helicity by `-2 t Γₐ Γ_b`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.mutualHelicity","kind":"def","line":279,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L279-L283","doc":"Mutual helicity of strands with circulations `Γ` and crossing matrix `C`:\n`Σₓ Σᵧ (C x y / 2) Γₓ Γᵧ`, which equals `2 Σ_{x<y} lk(x,y) Γₓ Γᵧ` when `C` is\nsymmetric with zero diagonal (Moffatt 1969's mutual term). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_lk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_lk","kind":"theorem","line":260,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L260-L275","doc":"**Linking number moves by exactly one.**  In the linking-number normalisation\n`lk = C / 2`, a crossing change between distinct strands `a ≠ b` changes\n`lk(a,b)` by exactly `-sgn e` (i.e. `∓1`), and only that pair (and its mirror)\nchanges. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossing_labels_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossing_labels_ne","kind":"theorem","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L251-L258","doc":"With injective labelling (distinct strands), the two strands meeting at a\ncrossing are distinct, so the crossing is genuinely **between** two strands. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.crossingChange_C","kind":"theorem","line":231,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L231-L249","doc":"**Crossing change.**  Flipping the sign of one letter changes the crossing matrix\nby exactly `-2 · sgn e` on the pair of strands `{a, b}` meeting at that crossing,\nand nowhere else.  Here `a, b` are the labels at the crossing's positions after\nthe prefix `w₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_pos_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_pos_injective","kind":"theorem","line":224,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L224-L229","doc":"Running preserves injectivity of the labelling. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_pos","kind":"theorem","line":219,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L219-L222","doc":"The position map does not depend on the crossing matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_C_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_C_add","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L204-L217","doc":"The crossing matrix accumulates additively: running from `⟨p, C⟩` gives the\nrun from `⟨p, 0⟩` shifted by `C`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_far","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_far","kind":"theorem","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L184-L200","doc":"**Far commutation** `σᵢσⱼ = σⱼσᵢ` for `i + 2 ≤ j`, independent signs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_braid","kind":"theorem","line":163,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L163-L180","doc":"**Braid relation** `σᵢσⱼσᵢ = σⱼσᵢσⱼ` for `j = i + 1`, any common sign `e`:\nboth sides leave the same position map and the same crossing matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.braid_core","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.braid_core","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L137-L161","doc":"Braid relation at three distinct abstract positions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.stepAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.stepAt","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L132-L135","doc":"One crossing at abstract positions `x, y`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_R2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_R2","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L120-L128","doc":"**Reidemeister II.**  `σᵢ^e σᵢ^{-e}` has no effect on the state. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump_comm","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L112-L116","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump_cancel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump_cancel","kind":"theorem","line":106,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L106-L110","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_congr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_congr","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L97-L102","doc":"**Context propagation.**  Two subwords with the same effect on every state can\nbe exchanged inside any word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_append","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_append","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L93-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_cons","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_cons","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L91-L92","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run_nil","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L90-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.run","kind":"def","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L87-L88","doc":"Run a braid word. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.step","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.step","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L81-L85","doc":"One crossing: strands at positions `i` and `i+1` cross with sign `sgn e`, then\nswap positions. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.C","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.C","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.pos","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L78-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St.mk","kind":"ctor","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.St","kind":"structure","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L76-L79","doc":"Running state: position-to-label map and signed crossing matrix. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.bump","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L72-L74","doc":"Symmetric increment of the crossing matrix by `s` on the pair `(a, b)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.sgn_not","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.sgn_not","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.sgn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.sgn","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L67-L68","doc":"The crossing sign of a letter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.Letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.VortexLink.Letter","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/VortexLinkTopology.lean#L64-L65","doc":"A braid letter on `n + 1` strands: generator index and sign (`true` = `σᵢ`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}